    {
      "kind": "narrative",
      "text": "For SFO–Bangkok departing January 15, 2027, I would start with the Aeroplan economy option via Hong Kong that arrives on January 16. The main choice is whether to leave before noon and reach Bangkok that evening, or preserve most of your departure day and arrive the following morning. A Turkish Airlines business-cabin award offers a different comfort choice, but requires separate positioning to Los Angeles and a substantially longer trip.",
      "label": null,
      "reference_kind": null,
      "canonical_id": null,
      "journey": null,
      "component": null,
      "lead": null,
      "unavailable": false
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrative",
      "text": "My first choice, “Earlier Bangkok arrival,” leaves SFO at 11:45 a.m. on January 15 and reaches Bangkok at 10:25 p.m. on January 16, taking 19 hours 40 minutes. That gets you there 11 hours 25 minutes before the late-departure option below, at the cost of leaving 11 hours 30 minutes earlier. Both carry the same observed quote of 65,000 Aeroplan points plus CAD 107.40, with price scope unspecified. The Hong Kong connection is only 1 hour 10 minutes, so verify the itinerary and connection before committing.",
      "label": null,
      "reference_kind": null,
      "canonical_id": null,
      "journey": null,
      "component": null,
      "lead": null,
      "unavailable": false
    },
