    {
      "kind": "narrative",
      "text": "For comfort instead, “Business award via Los Angeles” combines an Alaska cash flight to LAX with a Turkish award via Istanbul, quoted at 275,000 Miles&Smiles miles plus a USD 121 positioning fare and unreported award taxes. It leaves SFO at 1:14 p.m. on January 15 and reaches Bangkok at 8:50 a.m. on January 17: 28 hours 36 minutes overall, including 3 hours 49 minutes at LAX. That is nine hours longer than the late Aeroplan option for an arrival only one hour earlier. Consider it only if the reported business cabin is worth the longer routing and separate-ticket arrangement; Miles&Smiles miles and Aeroplan points are different currencies, not directly comparable costs.",
      "label": null,
      "reference_kind": null,
      "canonical_id": null,
      "journey": null,
      "component": null,
      "lead": null,
      "unavailable": false
    },
